QGC WPL 110
# ============================================================================
# RUNWAY AUTOLAND MISSION v7 - SHORT FINAL BASELINE
# ============================================================================
#
# Archived landing-tuning mission retained for historical comparison with v8.
# Moved out of config/ into missions/archive/ during mission-library cleanup.
#
# Goal:
#   1. Approach low and parallel to runway
#   2. Touch down at speed (wheels contact ground)
#   3. Roll out on wheels while decelerating
#   4. Come to complete stop
#
# Approach strategy:
#   - Final approach at 3m altitude, almost parallel to runway
#   - Maintain airspeed for control and rollout
#   - Minimal flare (just protect propeller)
#   - Touchdown with forward speed, roll to stop
#
# ============================================================================

# Home position (set at arming location)
0	1	0	16	0	0	0	0	-35.363262	149.165237	0	1

# WP1: TAKEOFF - climb to 50m
1	0	3	22	15.0	0	0	0	-35.363262	149.165237	50	1

# WP2: First cruise waypoint - 200m NORTH, 60m altitude
2	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.361500	149.165237	60	1

# WP3: Second cruise waypoint - 250m EAST
3	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.361500	149.168000	60	1

# WP4: Third cruise waypoint - turn back SOUTH
4	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.364000	149.168000	60	1

# WP5: Far south - 800m south of home for approach alignment
5	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.370500	149.165237	60	1

# WP6: LOITER_TO_ALT - Circle down to 10m altitude
6	0	3	31	1	60	0	0	-35.369500	149.165237	10	1

# DO_LAND_START marker - landing sequence begins here
7	0	3	189	0	0	0	0	0	0	0	1

# ============================================================================
# STAIRCASE DESCENT - GRADUAL STEP-DOWN TO WHEEL HEIGHT
# ============================================================================

# WP8: Step 1 - 500m south at 4m altitude
8	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.367754	149.165237	4	1

# WP9: Step 2 - 300m south at 2m altitude
9	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.365957	149.165237	2	1

# WP10: Step 3 - 100m south at 1.5m altitude
10	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.364160	149.165237	1.5	1

# WP11: Step 4 - 30m south at 1.5m altitude
11	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.363532	149.165237	1.5	1

# WP12: NAV_LAND - touchdown zone
12	0	3	21	0	0	0	0	-35.363262	149.165237	0	1
